  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m \u0130kilisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nDengeni do\u011Fru sa\u011Flaman ve yere s\u0131k\u0131
    basman gereken zamanlarda ciddiyeti elden b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n olmu\u015F.
    \"Nas\u0131l olsa yapar\u0131m\" d\xFC\u015F\xFCncesi ve engellerin kendili\u011Finden
    a\u015F\u0131laca\u011F\u0131na inanmak, seni yava\u015Flatan hatta t\xF6kezleten
    hatalar\u0131nm\u0131\u015F. Bir noktada i\u015Fler senin i\xE7in hem \xF6zel
    hayat\u0131nda hem de maddi a\xE7\u0131dan s\u0131ras\u0131yla sarpa sarm\u0131\u015F...
    Elinde olanlar\u0131 havaya savururcas\u0131na bir bo\u015F vermi\u015Flik i\xE7ine
    girmi\u015Fsin. Her \u015Feyi masaya yat\u0131r\u0131p, bir de\u011Ferlendirme
    yap\u0131p, azami titizli\u011Fi g\xF6stermeye ba\u015Flaman gereken nokta ile
    bulu\u015Fmu\u015F ve kendini biraz olsun toparlamaya niyetlenmi\u015Fsin {{isim}}.
    Bu konuda ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131 da olmu\u015Fsun. Enerjini do\u011Fru yere
    kanalize etti\u011Finde yapamaca\u011F\u0131n \u015Fey olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    san\u0131r\u0131m o d\xF6nemlerde iyi anlad\u0131n."
